The question about wishing for an artifact is a hard one.  I'd
might wish for Magicbane if I were lawful or chaotic, since I
know I'm not going to get it otherwise.  But the problem about
wishing for an artifact is that you do have to do it fairly
soon.  Before you've seen too many other artifacts.  You can't
put off wishing for Grayswandir until after you've sacrificed a
lot to see if you get it, for example, because by then, you'll
have gotten enough other junk that you won't get it from a wish.

> If I were super early in the game I would save a wish for
