with GDSM and the amulet of reflection.  I like to keep the
cloak slot open for a robe (which allows even combat wombats to
cast a few useful spells, like cure sickness).  If I can't
twoweapon, I'll might go with a silver shield as well.  But I've
played it both ways, with SDSM and a CoMR.

For the most part, I've not used AoLS.  Most of the times I die,
I don't think they'd save me, because what killed me would still
be there.  (There are one or two exceptions, but they should
